      ],
      "why_read": "Learn how pairing an LLM with the Z3 constraint solver can synthesize concrete reproducers for latent Go runtime panics that standard fuzzing overlooks. You will understand how targeting uneliminated compiler bounds checks provides a precise method for bug hunting.",
